{"name":"Young Greens","hex":"#97d499","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"young","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["In the early part of growth or life; born not long ago.","At an early stage of existence or development; having recently come into existence."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Offspring, especially the immature offspring of animals."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/young"},{"term":"greens","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Leaves and leaf-like parts of edible plants when eaten as vegetables or in salads.","Green vegetables; edible plants or plant parts that contain chlorophyll."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["plural of green"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/greens"}],"entries":[{"title":"Australian Young Greens","blocks":[{"text":"The Australian Young Greens is a federation of Young Greens groups from each Australian greens party. Collectively, they form the youth wing of the Australian Greens, representing members aged 31 and under. The Queensland Young Greens represent members aged 25 and under."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e6/Australian_Young_Greens_Logo.jpg/330px-Australian_Young_Greens_Logo.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Australian_Young_Greens","wikidata":"Q15980910"},{"title":"Federation of Young European Greens","blocks":[{"text":"The Federation of Young European Greens, often referred to as FYEG, is an umbrella organisation that gathers young green movements and organisations across Europe with 40,000 members. FYEG's aim is to defend climate and social justice on the European level. Since 2007, FYEG is the European Green Party's youth wing."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1e/FYEG_logo_2022.png/330px-FYEG_logo_2022.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Federation_of_Young_European_Greens","wikidata":"Q1117600"},{"title":"Young Greens (Ireland)","blocks":[{"text":"Young Greens is a youth political organisation in Ireland that acts as the youth branch of the Green Party and the Green Party in Northern Ireland. As a youth party they focus on issues that affect young people including access to education, affordable housing, drug policy, LGBTQI+ rights and reproductive rights.The Young Greens believe in social and economic justice for all as well as environmental sustainability for the future."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/e/e5/Young_Greens_Ireland.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Young_Greens_(Ireland)","wikidata":"Q8058148"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ee/Katri_Ylinen.jpg/500px-Katri_Ylinen.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ee/Katri_Ylinen.jpg/1280px-Katri_Ylinen.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ee/Katri_Ylinen.jpg/500px-Katri_Ylinen.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Katri Ylinen, FYEG Co-Spokesperson 2018-2019","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AKatri_Ylinen.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2a/Youth_In_Crisis_%28cropped%29.jpg/500px-Youth_In_Crisis_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2a/Youth_In_Crisis_%28cropped%29.jpg/1280px-Youth_In_Crisis_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2a/Youth_In_Crisis_%28cropped%29.jpg/500px-Youth_In_Crisis_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A flag used by the organisation","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AYouth_In_Crisis_(cropped).jpg"}],"sounds":{"young":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/04/En-uk-young.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/04/En-uk-young.ogg/En-uk-young.ogg.mp3"},{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/69/En-us-young.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/69/En-us-young.ogg/En-us-young.ogg.mp3"}],"greens":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e4/En-us-greens.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/e4/En-us-greens.ogg/En-us-greens.ogg.mp3"}]}}}